      "zh": {
        "title": "巴基斯坦國際航空改用自有777 恢復英國航班",
        "summary": "Norse Atlantic 暫停代飛後，巴基斯坦國際航空改以自有波音777接手英國航班。",
        "body": [
          "路透社報導，巴基斯坦國際航空11月26日宣佈恢復英國航班，改以自有波音777機隊執飛。此前，提供飛機及機組的 Norse Atlantic 暫停代飛，導致11月25日自倫敦和曼徹斯特起飛的兩班航班取消。",
          "Norse Atlantic 10月曾宣佈以兩架波音787-9提供含機組的濕租服務。巴基斯坦國際航空表示，正評估後續機隊安排，包括其他臨時運能方案。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "PIA restores UK flights using its own Boeing 777 fleet",
        "summary": "Pakistan International Airlines switched to its own Boeing 777s after wet-lease partner Norse Atlantic suspended operations.",
        "body": [
          "Pakistan International Airlines said on November 26 that it had restored UK services using its own Boeing 777 fleet, Reuters reported. A suspension by its wet-lease partner Norse Atlantic forced the cancellation of two flights from London and Manchester a day earlier.",
          "Norse Atlantic had announced in October that it would provide two Boeing 787-9s with crews under the lease. PIA said it was assessing further fleet arrangements, including other temporary capacity options."
        ]
      },
